ParentVault_deposit
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the amount is less than MIN_DEPOSIT_AMOUNT
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__AmountTooSmall
├── when the epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
└── when the deposit is valid
    ├── it should transfer USDC from the depositor to the vault
    ├── it should update the depositor's deposit mapping
    ├── it should update the epoch total deposit amount
    ├── it should accumulate multiple deposits correctly
    ├── it should return the current epoch nonce
    └── it should emit DepositSubmitted
